<section class="util-page" data-util="wallet-intelligence">
  <form class="search-bar" data-search>
    <input type="text" name="q" placeholder="STX address — e.g. SP2J6Y09JMFWWZCT4VJX0BA5W7A9HZP5EX96Y6VZY" autocomplete="off" required />
    <button type="submit" class="search-exec" aria-label="Execute">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16"><path fill="currentColor" d="m21 20-5.6-5.6A8 8 0 1 0 14.4 15.4L20 21zM4 10a6 6 0 1 1 12 0 6 6 0 0 1-12 0z"/></svg>
    </button>
  </form>

  <section class="instructions">
    <h3>Run a contributor dossier</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Tap the search field.</li>
      <li>Paste any Stacks (STX) address.</li>
      <li>Execute to resolve activity sources and derived intelligence.</li>
      <li>Review the contributor profile — signals, tier, tags, breakdown.</li>
      <li>Save the dossier to preserve it across sessions.</li>
      <li>Export a branded card any time from Saved Searches.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="result" id="result" hidden></section>
</section>
